{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04569","headline":"江路忆郡 · 张说","name":"江路忆郡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雾敛江早明，星翻汉将没。\n卧闻峡猿响，起视榜人发。\n倚棹攀岸筱，凭船弄波月。\n水宿厌洲渚，晨光屡挥忽。\n林泽来不穷，烟波去无歇。\n结思笙竽里，摇情游侠窟。\n年貌不暂留，欢愉及玄髪。\n云涓恋山海，禽马怀燕越。\n自非行役人，安知慕城阙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}